  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: SayuriSickIntermission2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334392
    - rid: 4927988452881334393
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Moooo...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913216
    - rid: 4927988476395913218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... do you usually moo when you're sick, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913219
    - rid: 4927988476395913220
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Nah, I'm just sooo boooored...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913221
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure how to help with that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913274
    - rid: 4927988476395913275
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Read me a story, or something...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913276
    - rid: 4927988476395913277
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, right. How could I not think of that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913278
    - rid: 4927988476395913279
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>And could you get me that ice pack-</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913280
    - rid: 4927988476395913282
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>(Dang it.)</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913281
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913283
    - rid: 4927988476395913284
    - rid: 4927988476395913285
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hmm... what kind of story would Sayori like me to read?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913286
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah, I'll just read her something similar to what she read in the literature
      club, if I can find it.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913287
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... Now that I'm thinking about it...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913289
    - rid: 4927988476395913290
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm not sure I've ever seen Sayori read a book.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913291
    - rid: 4927988476395913293
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I should've just asked her what kind of book she wanted me to read...
      huuuhh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913292
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: You have something on your mind, apprentice?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913295
    - rid: 4927988476395913296
    - rid: 4927988476395913297
    - rid: 4927988476395913298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh... yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988476395913299
    - rid: 4927988476395913300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm looking for some...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Light</i> reading material.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988544189497344
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: That right? I figured your recreational reading would be more complex,
      if your study habits are to be believed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781120
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: You would be correct-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781121
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: But the book isn't for me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781122
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: ... right...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you're lucky that some students in our college's history had the
      esteemed pleasure of trying to raise offspring while studying.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781123
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Does that... happen often?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781124
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Not really, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781126
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: But the few we've had brought along their personal collection of children's
      stories-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Which they donated to our library once their children had matured.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: So if that's what you're looking for-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A children's story would probably work, yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Then here you are: a copy of <i>The Fat Mother</i>.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a folktale about the origins of the humble bee.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you very much, Mr. gro-Shub.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781131
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781132
    - rid: 4927988565371781133
    - rid: 4927988565371781134
    - rid: 4927988565371781135
    - rid: 4927988565371781136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm back with your story, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781137
    - rid: 4927988565371781138
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Thank you, Yuri...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781139
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Ahem</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781140
    - rid: 4927988565371781141
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '<i>The Fat Mother</i>:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781142
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri begins reading The Fat Mother...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What an interesting folktale.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781146
    - rid: 4927988565371781147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, I'm a bit vexed by the repeated teat-suckling...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781148
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you like it, Sayori-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Get your rest, Sayori.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781151
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781152
    - rid: 4927988565371781153
    - rid: 4927988565371781154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Now... how shall I spend the rest of my day?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I suppose I'll get started reading through the notebook Ms. Ervine gave
      me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781156
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri makes her way to the Arcanaeum, eager to study her new material.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781157
    - rid: 4927988565371781158
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
